    {
      "section_id": "SEC034",
      "title": "Selecting Your Thoughts",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Look at Philippians chapter 4 verse 8. It tells us how to walk there — not only in the quiet of the night, but as you walk your walk going home in the taxi, in the car, in the bus, or flying in the airplane.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA133",
            "REF027",
            "EX021",
            "SRC003581",
            "SRC003583",
            "SRC003584",
            "SRC003585",
            "SRC003586",
            "SRC003589"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC003581",
            "SRC003583",
            "SRC003584",
            "SRC003585",
            "SRC003586",
            "SRC003589",
            "SRC003590",
            "SRC003591",
            "SRC003592",
            "SRC003593",
            "SRC003594",
            "SRC003597",
            "SRC003491",
            "SRC003492"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA133"
          ],
          "example_refs": [
            "EX021"
          ],
          "reference_refs": [
            "REF027"
          ],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000007",
          "provider_handle": "p7"
        },
        {
          "text": "Finally, brethren: all that is true, all that is honorable, all that is just, all that is pure, all that is wonderful, everything that is worthy of praise — dwell on these things.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA133",
            "SRC003590",
            "SRC003591",
            "SRC003592",
            "SRC003593",
            "SRC003594",
            "SRC003597"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC003590",
            "SRC003591",
            "SRC003592",
            "SRC003593",
            "SRC003594",
            "SRC003597",
            "SRC003581",
            "SRC003583",
            "SRC003584",
            "SRC003585",
            "SRC003589"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA133"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000008",
          "provider_handle": "p8"
        },
        {
          "text": "There are things that will be happening around you. Are they pure things? Are they excellent things? Are they things worthy of praise? You have a great deal of selection — many things you can think about. Choose them deliberately, filtering for what is pure, what is excellent, what is praiseworthy.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA134",
            "SRC003608",
            "SRC003609",
            "SRC003610",
            "SRC003611",
            "SRC003612",
            "SRC003613"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC003608",
            "SRC003609",
            "SRC003610",
            "SRC003611",
            "SRC003612",
            "SRC003613"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA134"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000009",
          "provider_handle": "p9"
        },
        {
          "text": "The battlefield of life is in the mind. It is in the thought. It is not won or lost by outward circumstance but by what you allow your thinking to dwell on.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA135",
            "SRC003617",
            "SRC003618",
            "SRC003619"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC003617",
            "SRC003618",
            "SRC003619"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA135"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000010",
          "provider_handle": "p10"
        }
      ],
