    {
      "section_id": "SEC035",
      "title": "Complete in the Head",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Remember what we read in Colossians 2. Verse 9 says all of God's fullness dwells in him — the head. Verse 10 says you are complete in him. You are completely in him. So you are completing him; so you are completing him.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA136",
            "REF028",
            "SRC003620",
            "SRC003624",
            "SRC003625",
            "SRC003626",
            "SRC003627",
            "SRC003628",
            "SRC003629",
            "SRC003631",
            "SRC003636",
            "SRC003637"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC003620",
            "SRC003624",
            "SRC003625",
            "SRC003626",
            "SRC003627",
            "SRC003628",
            "SRC003629",
            "SRC003631",
            "SRC003636",
            "SRC003637"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA136"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [
            "REF028"
          ],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000011",
          "provider_handle": "p11"
        },
        {
          "text": "The principalities and powers you are wrestling with are not flesh and blood. You wrestle not against flesh and blood, but against principalities and powers, against spiritual wickedness in the heavenly places.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA137",
            "REF029",
            "SRC003664",
            "SRC003674",
            "SRC003676",
            "SRC003677"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC003664",
            "SRC003674",
            "SRC003676",
            "SRC003677"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA137"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [
            "REF029"
          ],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000012",
          "provider_handle": "p12"
        },
        {
          "text": "Do you think the head will function without the body? The head is so powerful, and yet his body is riddled with sickness, with all kinds of infirmity, all kinds of poverty and penury. Something is wrong with our doctrine.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA138",
            "SRC003682",
            "SRC003688",
            "SRC003689",
            "SRC003690",
            "SRC003691",
            "SRC003692"
          ],
